data i4_seed_retained_note: String = "Seed oracle: v1_compiler::v2_compiler_infer in src/v1/stage0 (hand-retained, independent of emitted artifact). Dissolve-on: generic seed-shim assembly (still-pike-676) lands + #6775 Rc/Optional emit surface greens, giving a faithful cargo verdict; frontier flips SelfEmitted then."

